<title>USA: Most IMM currencies close higher, yen ends lower.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currencies close higher, yen ends lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 19 - Most IMM currency futures closed higher. Yen crept off session lows, but remained on the defensive due to profit-taking of long yen/short mark positions. Sept marks hit daily highs late in the day at $0.5845, but momentum above $0.5842, or 1.7225 spot marks, was weak, traders said.</p>
